  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Evidencebased Planning SEP Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To providing technical hands-on support on data-driven and evidence-based planning to the Government of Timor-Leste to strengthen the government&#x2019;s capacity in its planning and coordination. The support is given through three components, which are High Frequency phone-based survey, national census, and voluntary national review on the SDG implementation. HiFy Survey and National Census are essential in providing the actual data of the country&#x2019;s situational analysis to be used as a background in delivering different initiatives by policymakers and development actors.</narrative>
  </description>
